## Reviewer disagreements (not applied)

- a#1. "TWD 1.57M" is pinned. Expanding it to "1.57 លាន…" would break the preserved-term check. The English M is a product token, not a Khmer abbreviation to gloss.
- a#14. "វិសាលភាពនិងថ្លៃ" exceeds the 14-character nav cap. Round 1 already chose the spaced 13-character form for that reason.
- a#13 and b#11. Joining the 1980 when-clause to the next sentence, and deleting U+200B, would change the Korean-pinned block count or the zero-width count. Each dangling clause was repaired inside its own block instead.
- b#1 suggested "រួមទាំងអ្នកនាំចូលដែលធ្វើជាអ្នកចែកចាយ". The sentence already names អ្នកនាំចូលនៅតៃវ៉ាន់ as the subject. Repeating អ្នកនាំចូល inside the parenthesis doubles it. The rewrite is "រួមទាំងអ្នកដែលធ្វើជាអ្នកចែកចាយ".
- b#14 suggested folding the notarization into the conditional. That would merge two blocks. The conditional now has its own main clause; the notarization sentence stays in the next block.
- b#9's OR registration was not swept into 001. 001's "ការចុះបញ្ជីក្រុមហ៊ុននិងពាណិជ្ជ (公司及商業登記)" is the official combined registry name. 017's English is "company or business registration", so only 017 takes ឬ.
- Reviewer rewrites that use ្ត were not copied. The file standard remains subscript ្ដ and ឱ្យ.
